# Every grind on the ledge, frontside: ledge on the right (the regular rider faces it), so the far
# side is right and right = toward. 50-50, then I + direction switches through the grinds table.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport 0 1.1 0.14 90
hold up 6..100
hold ollie 90..105
tap grind 176
tap grind+up 200
tap grind+down 222
tap grind+down+right 244
tap grind+down+left 266
tap grind+up+right 288
tap grind+up+left 310
tap grind+right 332
bot balance
run 560
expect event grindStart{trick=FS 50-50} within 177..178
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Nosegrind} within 201..202
expect event grindStart{trick=FS 5-0} within 223..224
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Feeble Grind} within 245..246
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Smith Grind} within 267..268
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Crooked Grind} within 289..290
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Overcrook} within 311..312
expect event grindStart{trick=FS Feeble Grind} within 333..334
expect no event bail
